# 🔍 Deals Dashboard - Comprehensive Analysis

## Overview

**Deals Dashboard** is a full-featured **Next.js 14 Admin Dashboard** for managing an e-commerce deals and cashback platform. It follows **Clean Architecture** principles with clear separation between domain, data, and presentation layers.

---

## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Presentation["Presentation Layer"]
        Pages["Pages (app/)"]
        CoreComp["Core Components"]
        UIComp["UI Components (Radix)"]
    end
    
    subgraph Domain["Domain Layer"]
        Services["Services"]
        Entities["Entities"]
        Repos["Repository Interfaces"]
        UseCases["Use Cases"]
    end
    
    subgraph Data["Data Layer"]
        RepoImpl["Repository Implementations"]
        Mappers["Mappers"]
        API["API Client"]
    end
    
    subgraph Infrastructure["Infrastructure Layer"]
        DI["DI Container"]
        Storage["Storage (Token/Admin)"]
        Config["Configuration"]
    end
    
    Pages --> CoreComp
    CoreComp --> Services
    Services --> Repos
    Repos -.->|Implemented by| RepoImpl
    RepoImpl --> Mappers
    RepoImpl --> API
    DI --> Services
    DI --> RepoImpl
    API --> Storage
```

---

## 📁 Project Structure

| Directory | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `app/` | Next.js App Router pages and layouts |
| `components/` | Radix UI primitives with shadcn/ui styling |
| `core/` | Business components, hooks, localization, utils |
| `domain/` | Entities, services, repository interfaces |
| `data/` | API client, mappers, repository implementations |
| `infrastructure/` | DI container, storage, configuration |
| `locales/` | i18n translations (EN/AR) |
| `hooks/` | Shared React hooks |
| `styles/` | Global CSS |

